      "provenance": "Official libretro stable core bundle accompanying RetroArch 1.22.2 Linux x86_64, published 2025-11-20, retrieved 2026-09-01. Version-addressed under /stable/1.22.2/ and immutable: it replaces the four rolling /nightly/linux/x86_64/latest/ core URLs Release 001 pinned, whose bytes had already changed upstream and made Release 001 unreconstructable. Ships 199 libretro cores as bare .so members under RetroArch-Linux-x86_64/RetroArch-Linux-x86_64.AppImage.home/.config/retroarch/cores/; RetroFrontier derives only the four approved cores from it. The declared licence is the bundle's aggregate; each derived core component records its own upstream licence."
